<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z" agent="Antigravity" version="21.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="Slide_6_-_Methodology_Workflow" name="Slide 6 - Methodology Workflow"><mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="794" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1100" pageHeight="850" background="#0B0F19" math="0" shadow="1"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;h2 style='margin:0;color:#38BDF8;'&gt;RESEARCH METHODOLOGY &amp; WORKFLOW&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div style='color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;'&gt;A 4-Phase Systematic Framework for Analyzing &amp; Mitigating RAG Hallucinations&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="30" width="500" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p1" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;'&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#2563EB;color:#FFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;PHASE 1&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;b style='color:#F8FAFC;font-size:15px;margin-left:8px;'&gt;Literature Collection &amp; Screening&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='color:#CBD5E1;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;'&gt;• Screened 50+ seminal papers (2020–2026)&lt;br/&gt;• Sources: NeurIPS, ICLR, ACL, TACL, NAACL, ACM Surveys&lt;br/&gt;• Filtered to 8 core empirical &amp; architectural benchmarks&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=10;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="110" width="540" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p2" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;'&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#0891B2;color:#FFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;PHASE 2&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;b style='color:#F8FAFC;font-size:15px;margin-left:8px;'&gt;Taxonomy &amp; Error Decomposition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='color:#CBD5E1;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;'&gt;• Formalized Intrinsic (conflict) vs Extrinsic (unverifiable) taxonomy&lt;br/&gt;• Deconstructed 7 empirical root causes across RAG pipeline&lt;br/&gt;• Quantified failure distribution across vector &amp; generation stages&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#06B6D4;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=10;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="240" width="540" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p3" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;'&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#7C3AED;color:#FFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;PHASE 3&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;b style='color:#F8FAFC;font-size:15px;margin-left:8px;'&gt;Comparative Benchmarking&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='color:#CBD5E1;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;'&gt;• Architectures: Standalone LLM vs Fine-Tuning vs Naive/Modular RAG&lt;br/&gt;• Detection: NLI-verification vs LLM-as-Judge (RAGAS, ARES)&lt;br/&gt;• Mitigation: CRAG (corrective) vs Self-RAG (reflection) vs Hybrid Search&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=10;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="370" width="540" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p4" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;'&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='display:inline-block;background:#059669;color:#FFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;PHASE 4&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;b style='color:#F8FAFC;font-size:15px;margin-left:8px;'&gt;Gap Analysis &amp; Strategic Roadmap&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;div style='color:#CBD5E1;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;'&gt;• Diagnosed trade-offs: Latency overhead vs Faithfulness precision&lt;br/&gt;• Identified open frontiers: Multi-agent verification, dynamic gating&lt;br/&gt;• Synthesized 3-phase industry roadmap toward Zero-Hallucination RAG&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=10;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="500" width="540" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_p1_p2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#38BDF8;strokeWidth=2.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" source="p1" target="p2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_p2_p3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#38BDF8;strokeWidth=2.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" source="p2" target="p3" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_p3_p4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#38BDF8;strokeWidth=2.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" parent="1" source="p3" target="p4" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>